变），但 CI 收窄约 √(250/49)≈2.26 倍。s025 已有\n      实际 n=250 数据（d_z=1.12, p=4.3e-39, r=0.87）验证了这一\n      预期。其余 3 个 sparsity 按 n=49 d_z 模式外推：d_z 稳定在\n      1.02-1.12 区间。median_diff 绝对值随 sparsity 单调递增\n      （0.059→0.183→0.376→1.046），反映 compound severity 的\n      dose-response 关系在 LLaMA 上同样成立。关键对比：LLaMA s030\n      median_diff≈1.05 远小于 DeepSeek s030≈8.48 和 Qwen s030≈3.16，\n      说明 compound interaction 的绝对量级是 architecture-dependent 的；\n      但 d_z 一致 >1.0 说明效应的 relative magnitude（相对于 within-\n      problem variance）跨架构稳健。这一模式支持 \"phase gradient\n      universality\" 的 core narrative。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table X: LLaMA n=250 importance phase gradient summary\"\n        columns: [\"sparsity\", \"high_II_median\", \"low_II_median\", \"median_diff\", \"d_z\", \"95% CI\", \"Bonferroni p\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s015\", 0.003, 0.062, 0.059, 1.03, \"[0.82, 1.28]\", \"2.0e-32\"]\n          - [\"s020\", 0.007, 0.190, 0.183, 1.08, \"[0.89, 1.30]\", \"3.2e-36\"]\n          - [\"s025*\", 0.017, 0.388, 0.376, 1.12, \"[0.93, 1.34]\", \"1.7e-38\"]\n          - [\"s030\", 0.034, 1.080, 1.046, 1.02, \"[0.84, 1.24]\", \"1.2e-34\"]\n        note: \"* s025 为 c8_llama_gpu0_s025 实际数据\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 三架构 importance phase gradient d_z 对比柱状图（DS medium-to-large 0.44-0.80 / QW 0.37-1.44 / LLaMA all >1.0），highlight universality\"\n      - \"Fig: LLaMA n=250 per-phase II median 随 sparsity 变化的折线图（3 lines: high/mid/low phase），显示 phase separation 随 sparsity 递增\"\n    analysis: >\n      Importance phase gradient 在 LLaMA n=250 下全部 4 个 sparsity\n      级别 Bonferroni p < 1e-30，d_z 一致 >1.0。这是 C8 claim 中\n      最强的证据——phase gradient 的 universality 跨架构成立。注意\n      LLaMA d_z (≈1.0-1.1) 甚至高于 DeepSeek 早期数据 (0.44-0.80)，\n      但 median_diff 绝对值远小（LLaMA s030≈1.05 vs DS≈8.48）。\n      这意味着 LLaMA 的 within-problem variance 更小，使得 d_z\n      inflate，论文需注意同时报告 d_z 和 median_diff 以避免误导。\n      n=250 的功效远超需要（power>0.999），支持 §4 报告 \"the\n      importance phase gradient is robust across architectures with\n      uniformly large effect sizes.\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Experiment 2: LLaMA n=250 Random Phase Gradient (Full)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"LLaMA n=250 Random Phase Gradient (Full Suite)\"\n    plan_id: \"c8_llama_n250_random\"\n    claim: \"C8\"\n    description: >\n      DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B, n=250, random masking,\n      4 sparsity levels. 验证 n=49 观察到的 LLaMA random non-trivial\n      phase gradient 在更大样本下是否持续且 CI 稳定排除零。\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 250\n      n_valid: 244\n      n_bootstrap: 10000\n      per_phase_ii_median:\n        s015:\n          high: 0.020\n          mid: 0.035\n          low: 0.052\n        s020:\n          high: 0.038\n          mid: 0.068\n          low: 0.105\n        s025:\n          high: 0.085\n          mid: 0.170\n          low: 0.290\n        s030:\n          high: 0.155\n          mid: 0.340\n          low: 0.560\n      phase_gradient_median_diff:\n        s015: 0.032\n        s020: 0.067\n        s025: 0.205\n        s030: 0.405\n      phase_gradient_median_diff_ci95:\n        s015: [0.014, 0.054]\n        s020: [0.035, 0.105]\n        s025: [0.130, 0.295]\n        s030: [0.260, 0.570]\n      phase_gradient_random_dz:\n        s015: 0.30\n        s020: 0.33\n        s025: 0.38\n        s030: 0.37\n      phase_gradient_random_dz_ci:\n        s015: [0.17, 0.44]\n        s020: [0.20, 0.47]\n        s025: [0.25, 0.52]\n        s030: [0.24, 0.51]\n      wilcoxon_p_one_sided:\n        s015: 8.0e-5\n        s020: 2.0e-5\n        s025: 5.0e-7\n        s030: 8.0e-7\n      bonferroni_p_k4:\n        s015: 3.2e-4\n        s020: 8.0e-5\n        s025: 2.0e-6\n        s030: 3.2e-6\n      bonferroni_all_significant: true\n      all_ci_exclude_zero: true\n      interpretation: \"all_small\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      n=49 时 LLaMA random phase gradient d_z 0.35-0.44，CI 下界\n      均 >0（0.07-0.20）。这是与 DeepSeek/Qwen 的关键差异：Qwen2\n      架构上 random phase gradient 在 s015/s020 NS（DS s015 p=0.86,\n      QW s015 p=0.17），而 LLaMA 全部显著。n=250 下效应量预期稳定\n      或略降（regression to mean），d_z 落在 0.30-0.38（median tier\n      范围 [0.25, 0.40]）。CI 收窄使全部 4 级 Bonferroni 显著。\n      d_z 略低于 n=49 估计是预期的——n=49 时 sampling variability\n      可能使 d_z 偏高（特别是 s025 d_z=0.45 → n=250 预期 0.38）。\n      Random phase gradient 的 significance 意味着在 LLaMA 上，\n      compound interaction 的 phase-dependence 不是 strategy-specific\n      的——importance 和 random eviction 都产生 phase gradient，\n      importance 只是量级更大。机制假说：LLaMA 架构的 GQA (grouped\n      query attention) 使得 head pruning 即使在 random 条件下也\n      系统性地更多影响某些 phase 的 attention pattern，而 Qwen2\n      的 MHA 结构下 random pruning 的影响更均匀分布在 phases 间。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table X: Random phase gradient cross-architecture comparison\"\n        columns: [\"sparsity\", \"LLaMA d_z (n=250)\", \"DS d_z (n=500)\", \"QW d_z (n=500)\", \"LLaMA sig?\", \"DS sig?\", \"QW sig?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s015\", 0.30, \"—\", \"—\", \"✓\", \"NS (p=0.86)\", \"NS (p=0.17)\"]\n          - [\"s020\", 0.33, \"—\", \"—\", \"✓\", \"NS (p=0.28)\", \"NS (p=0.20)\"]\n          - [\"s025\", 0.38, \"—\", \"—\", \"✓\", \"✓ (p=0.006)\", \"✓ (p<1e-10)\"]\n          - [\"s030\", 0.37, \"—\", \"—\", \"✓\", \"✓ (p=0.006)\", \"✓ (p<1e-14)\"]\n        note: \"DS/QW random d_z not directly comparable (different test framework); sig status from c2_n500 Bonferroni\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Random phase gradient 三架构对比——LLaMA 全 4 级显著 (small effect) vs DS/QW 仅 s025+ 显著，highlight architecture-dependent pattern\"\n    analysis: >\n      Random phase gradient 在 LLaMA n=250 上全部 Bonferroni 显著\n      但为 small effect (d_z 0.30-0.38)，是论文中需诚实报告的关键\n      发现。它削弱 \"strategy specificity\" narrative 但加强 \"phase\n      gradient universality\" narrative。对 C8 的 implication：LLaMA\n      上 compound interaction 的 phase-dependence 是 strategy-\n      independent 的（importance 和 random 都有 phase gradient），\n      strategy 的作用仅在 magnitude modulation（importance d_z≈1.1\n      vs random d_z≈0.35，ratio≈3:1）。Discussion §5 需增加：\n      \"architecture-dependent strategy sensitivity\"，讨论 GQA vs\n      MHA 可能导致的差异。Limitations 中标注：LLaMA random phase\n      gradient 的机制为开放问题。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Experiment 3: LLaMA n=250 Strategy×Phase Interaction\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"LLaMA n=250 Strategy×Phase Interaction (imp_vs_rand d_z)\"\n    plan_id: \"c8_llama_n250_interaction\"\n    claim: \"C8\"\n    description: >\n      n=250 paired imp_vs_rand d_z analysis across 4 sparsity levels.\n      核心问题：n=49 时仅 s030 Bonferroni 显著 (p=0.029, d_z=0.34)，\n      n=250 是否将更多 sparsity 级别推入显著区。\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 250\n      n_valid: 244\n      bonferroni_k: 4\n      imp_vs_rand_dz:\n        s015: 0.16\n        s020: 0.21\n        s025: 0.27\n        s030: 0.34\n      imp_vs_rand_dz_ci:\n        s015: [-0.01, 0.33]\n        s020: [0.05, 0.38]\n        s025: [0.11, 0.44]\n        s030: [0.18, 0.50]\n      imp_vs_rand_dz_interpretation:\n        s015: negligible\n        s020: small\n        s025: small\n        s030: small\n      median_diff_imp_vs_rand:\n        s015: 0.027\n        s020: 0.116\n        s025: 0.171\n        s030: 0.641\n      median_diff_ci:\n        s015: [-0.003, 0.062]\n        s020: [0.012, 0.235]\n        s025: [0.040, 0.330]\n        s030: [0.210, 1.120]\n      wilcoxon_p_raw:\n        s015: 0.048\n        s020: 0.015\n        s025: 0.0008\n        s030: 0.00004\n      wilcoxon_p_bonferroni:\n        s015: 0.192\n        s020: 0.060\n        s025: 0.003\n        s030: 0.0002\n      significant_bonferroni:\n        s015: false\n        s020: false\n        s025: true\n        s030: true\n      bonferroni_sig_count_out_of_4: 2\n      imp_vs_rand_dz_monotonic: true\n      cross_arch_comparison:\n        deepseek_n500_imp_rand_ratio: \"15.5-38.6×\"\n        qwen_n500_imp_rand_ratio: \"2.7-20.1×\"\n        llama_n250_importance_over_random_dz_ratio:\n          s015: 3.4  # 1.03 / 0.30\n          s020: 3.3  # 1.08 / 0.33\n          s025: 2.9  # 1.12 / 0.38\n          s030: 2.8  # 1.02 / 0.37\n    result_rationale: >\n      n=49 的 imp_vs_rand d_z 为 0.19/0.26/0.29/0.34（s015→s030），\n      仅 s030 Bonferroni 显著 (p=0.029)。效应量是总体参数，n=250\n      不改变 d_z，但统计功效大幅提升（power from ~0.35 to >0.95 for\n      d_z=0.34）。具体推算：(1) d_z=0.34 at n=244: Wilcoxon p≈4e-5,\n      Bonferroni p≈0.0002 → highly significant; (2) d_z=0.27 at n=244:\n      p≈8e-4, Bonferroni p≈0.003 → significant; (3) d_z=0.21 at n=244:\n      p≈0.015, Bonferroni p≈0.060 → borderline NS (刚好不过 0.05);\n      (4) d_z=0.16 at n=244: p≈0.048, Bonferroni p≈0.19 → NS。因此\n      sig_count=2（s025+s030），落在 median tier 范围 [1, 2]。d_z\n      values 轻微收缩 vs n=49（regression to mean）：n=49 0.29→n=250\n      0.27 for s025，n=49 0.34→n=250 0.34 for s030（已在 asymptote）。\n      核心结论：imp_vs_rand 交互存在（monotonic d_z, 2/4 Bonferroni\n      sig），但为 small effect。对比 Qwen2 架构上 d_z 0.37-1.44\n      (median-to-large)，LLaMA 上 strategy×phase 交互弱了 3-4 倍。\n      这不是 null result（d_z 非零，且单调递增），而是 \"confirmed as\n      small\" —— 从 n=49 的 \"suggestive\" 升级为 n=250 的 \"definitively\n      small\"。论文中这是 informative：排除了 LLaMA 上存在强\n      strategy×phase 交互的可能性，支持 \"architecture-dependent\n      modulation\" 的 claim。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table X: imp_vs_rand d_z across architectures × sparsity\"\n        columns: [\"sparsity\", \"LLaMA d_z (n=250)\", \"DS d_z (ref)\", \"QW Cohen's d (ref)\", \"LLaMA Bonf. p\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s015\", 0.16, 0.44, 0.37, \"0.192 (NS)\"]\n          - [\"s020\", 0.21, 0.52, 0.72, \"0.060 (NS)\"]\n          - [\"s025\", 0.27, 0.68, 1.23, \"0.003 *\"]\n          - [\"s030\", 0.34, 0.80, 1.44, \"0.0002 **\"]\n        note: \"DS d_z from bf16 paired Cohen's d (different metric); QW Cohen's d from bf16_qw_imp paired test. Cross-metric comparison qualitative only.\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: imp_vs_rand d_z 对比三架构柱状图 — Qwen2 medium-to-large, DeepSeek medium, LLaMA small，清晰展示 architecture-dependent attenuation\"\n    analysis: >\n      C8 在 n=250 下维持 partially_confirmed。核心更新：\n      (1) importance phase gradient: confirmed at large effect (d_z>1.0, all Bonferroni sig) ✓;\n      (2) imp_vs_rand interaction: confirmed as small effect (d_z 0.16-0.34, 2/4 Bonferroni sig);\n      (3) random phase gradient: confirmed as non-trivial (d_z 0.30-0.38, all Bonferroni sig).\n      论文措辞 update: \"Cross-architecture replication on LLaMA-8B\n      (n=250) confirms the universality of phase-dependent compound\n      severity (importance d_z=1.02-1.12, all p<1e-30), while\n      revealing that strategy specificity is architecture-modulated:\n      the importance-over-random contrast is a small effect\n      (d_z=0.16-0.34, 2/4 Bonferroni significant) compared to\n      medium-to-large effects on Qwen2 architecture (Cohen's d\n      0.37-1.44). Notably, random masking on LLaMA also exhibits\n      significant phase gradients (d_z=0.30-0.38, all p<0.001),\n      unlike the null pattern at low sparsity on Qwen2 models.\"\n      C8 status 用词：partially_confirmed (qualitative direction ✓,\n      strategy specificity quantitatively weak).\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Experiment 4: GPQA DeepSeek Importance Phase Gradient\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"GPQA DeepSeek Importance Phase Gradient (Dose-Response)\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_importance\"\n    claim: \"C10_GPQA\"\n    description: >\n      DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B on GPQA-Diamond subset, n=50,\n      importance masking, 4 sparsity levels (s015/s020/s025/s030).\n      Per-problem paired median difference + Wilcoxon + bootstrap\n      (B=10000). 验证 phase gradient 在第三个 benchmark（跨领域\n      graduate-level reasoning）上的存在性和 dose-response。\n    expected_results:\n      model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\n      benchmark: GPQA-Diamond\n      n_problems: 50\n      n_valid: 48\n      n_bootstrap: 10000\n      method: \"median + Wilcoxon + bootstrap_median(B=10000)\"\n      importance:\n        s015:\n          median_gradient: 0.16\n          ci_low: 0.04\n          ci_high: 0.33\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.007\n        s020:\n          median_gradient: 0.50\n          ci_low: 0.22\n          ci_high: 0.85\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.0003\n        s025:\n          median_gradient: 1.40\n          ci_low: 0.65\n          ci_high: 2.30\n          wilcoxon_p: 2.0e-5\n        s030:\n          median_gradient: 3.15\n          ci_low: 1.55\n          ci_high: 5.20\n          wilcoxon_p: 5.0e-7\n      wilcoxon_p_bonferroni:\n        s015: 0.028\n        s020: 0.001\n        s025: 8.0e-5\n        s030: 2.0e-6\n      cohens_dz:\n        s015: 0.42\n        s020: 0.58\n        s025: 0.72\n        s030: 0.85\n      bonferroni_all_4_significant: true\n      dose_response_monotonic: true\n      dose_response_spearman_rho: 1.0\n      gpqa_vs_math500_ratio:\n        s015: 0.41  # 0.16 / 0.39\n        s020: 0.41  # 0.50 / 1.21\n        s025: 0.35  # 1.40 / 3.99\n        s030: 0.37  # 3.15 / 8.48\n    result_rationale: >\n      GPQA-Diamond 是 graduate-level 跨领域推理 benchmark（物理/\n      化学/生物等），与 MATH-500 的纯数学推理在三方面关键不同：\n      (1) 推理链更短——GPQA 问题通常不需要 MATH-500 那样长的 step-\n      by-step derivation，低 phase 区间更短，compound interaction\n      积累更少；(2) 涉及领域知识 recall 而非纯逻辑推演——knowledge\n      retrieval 对 KV cache 的依赖模式不同于 logical chaining；\n      (3) attention 模式在 phase 间可能更均匀——graduate-level\n      problems 的 \"thinking\" 和 \"answering\" 在 attention structure\n      上的差异小于 math proofs。因此 phase gradient 预期存在但量级\n      约为 MATH-500 的 35-41%（0.16/0.50/1.40/3.15 vs\n      0.39/1.21/3.99/8.48）。衰减比例与 GSM8K 互补：GSM8K 衰减因\n      推理链更简单（fewer phase-specific computations），GPQA 衰减\n      因跨领域知识检索减弱 phase specificity。s015 Bonferroni\n      p≈0.028 落在 median tier 目标 [0.01, 0.05] 内——足够显著但\n      远弱于 MATH-500 s015 的 p<1e-70，诚实反映 GPQA 效应较弱。\n      全 4 级显著是 median tier 的 optimistic 端——如果 s015 效应\n      更弱（median_diff≈0.10），Bonferroni p 可能 >0.05，此时\n      叙事调整为 \"gradient emerges at s020+ on GPQA\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table X: GPQA importance dose-response\"\n        columns: [\"sparsity\", \"median_gradient\", \"95% CI\", \"Bonferroni p\", \"d_z\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s015\", 0.16, \"[0.04, 0.33]\", 0.028, 0.42]\n          - [\"s020\", 0.50, \"[0.22, 0.85]\", 0.001, 0.58]\n          - [\"s025\", 1.40, \"[0.65, 2.30]\", \"8.0e-5\", 0.72]\n          - [\"s030\", 3.15, \"[1.55, 5.20]\", \"2.0e-6\", 0.85]\n      - name: \"Table X: Cross-benchmark importance gradient comparison\"\n        columns: [\"sparsity\", \"MATH-500 (DS n=500)\", \"GSM8K (DS n=50)\", \"GPQA (DS n=50)\", \"GPQA/MATH ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s015\", 0.39, 0.241, 0.16, \"0.41\"]\n          - [\"s020\", 1.21, 0.740, 0.50, \"0.41\"]\n          - [\"s025\", 3.99, 1.992, 1.40, \"0.35\"]\n          - [\"s030\", 8.48, 4.682, 3.15, \"0.37\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 三 benchmark importance dose-response 曲线对比 (MATH-500 >> GSM8K > GPQA)，显示 universal monotonic pattern with task-dependent magnitude\"\n      - \"Fig: GPQA per-phase II 分布 violin plot (n=50)，类似 fig4_per_problem_dist 格式\"\n    analysis: >\n      GPQA 确认 phase gradient 的 cross-benchmark robustness，\n      dose-response 单调递增且 Spearman ρ=1.0。GPQA 的量级约为\n      MATH-500 的 35-41%，衰减幅度略大于 GSM8K（GSM8K/MATH ≈\n      55-62%），形成 MATH-500 > GSM8K > GPQA 的量级梯度。三\n      benchmark 的重要共性：(1) 全部单调递增；(2) 全部 importance\n      显著；(3) dose-response Spearman ρ=1.0。差异：(1) 绝对量级\n      按 reasoning chain complexity 递减；(2) s015 的 significance\n      在 GPQA 上为 borderline（Bonf. p=0.028），而 MATH-500 上\n      overwhelmingly significant (p<1e-70)。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Experiment 5: GPQA DeepSeek Random Phase Gradient\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"GPQA DeepSeek Random Phase Gradient\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_random\"\n    claim: \"C10_GPQA\"\n    description: >\n      DeepSeek on GPQA-Diamond, n=50, random masking, 4 sparsity\n      levels. 测量 GPQA 上 strategy specificity (imp/rand ratio)\n      的衰减程度。\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 50\n      n_valid: 48\n      n_bootstrap: 10000\n      random:\n        s015:\n          median_gradient: 0.05\n          ci_low: -0.05\n          ci_high: 0.18\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.28\n        s020:\n          median_gradient: 0.15\n          ci_low: -0.02\n          ci_high: 0.38\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.06\n        s025:\n          median_gradient: 0.38\n          ci_low: 0.10\n          ci_high: 0.75\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.012\n        s030:\n          median_gradient: 0.92\n          ci_low: 0.35\n          ci_high: 1.65\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.002\n      wilcoxon_p_bonferroni:\n        s015: 1.0\n        s020: 0.24\n        s025: 0.048\n        s030: 0.008\n      significant_bonferroni:\n        s015: false\n        s020: false\n        s025: false  # 0.048 borderline, 保守报告为 NS\n        s030: true\n      random_dose_response_monotonic: true\n      imp_rand_ratio:\n        s015: 3.2\n        s020: 3.3\n        s025: 3.7\n        s030: 3.4\n      imp_rand_ratio_range: \"3.2-3.7×\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      GPQA 上 imp/rand ratio 预期为 2-5×，类 GSM8K 模式（MATH-500\n      为 15-36×）。三重衰减因素：(1) GPQA 跨领域 attention 模式更\n      均匀——importance score 的 phase-specific 判别力原本就弱于纯\n      数学推理，因此 importance 和 random eviction 的 compound effect\n      差异缩小；(2) GPQA 推理链较短，限制了 importance score 在\n      phase 间积累判别力差异的机会（fewer tokens = less discrimination\n      accumulation）；(3) graduate-level 问题涉及 factual recall，\n      attention pattern 在 thinking 和 answering 间的差异小于\n      mathematical derivation。具体校准：MATH-500 n=500 DS random\n      s025 median_diff=0.26, importance=3.99 → ratio=15.5×。GPQA\n      预期 random s025≈0.38, importance≈1.40 → ratio≈3.7×。GPQA\n      random 在 s030 Bonferroni 显著 (p≈0.008)，与 MATH-500 n=500\n      DS random s030 模式一致 (Bonf. p=0.006)——random 的 onset\n      threshold (~s025-s030) 跨 benchmark 相对稳定，但 ratio 衰减。\n      s025 Bonferroni p=0.048 技术上跨 0.05 threshold，保守报告\n      为 NS 以避免 borderline claim。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table X: imp/rand ratio across 3 benchmarks\"\n        columns: [\"benchmark\", \"ratio range\", \"pattern\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MATH-500 (DS n=500)\", \"15.5-38.6×\", \"strong specificity\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K (DS n=50)\", \"2.3-3.8×\", \"attenuated\"]\n          - [\"GPQA (DS n=50)\", \"3.2-3.7×\", \"attenuated\"]\n          - [\"MATH-500 (QW n=500)\", \"2.7-20.1×\", \"variable\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Strategy specificity (imp/rand ratio) 热力图: benchmark × sparsity level，MATH-500 暖色调 vs GSM8K/GPQA 冷色调\"\n    analysis: >\n      GPQA strategy specificity 衰减至 3.2-3.7×（vs MATH-500\n      15-36×），与 GSM8K 的 2.3-3.8× 处于同一数量级。Cross-benchmark\n      pattern: specificity ∝ reasoning chain complexity/length。\n      这对 C1 的 implication: strategy modulation 存在但其强度是\n      task-dependent 的，论文 C1 需加限定 \"strategy specificity is\n      most pronounced under demanding mathematical reasoning tasks\n      with extended inference chains, and attenuates on simpler or\n      cross-domain benchmarks to 2-5× range\"。GPQA 的加入使\n      cross-task 覆盖从 2 个 math benchmarks 扩展到 non-math\n      reasoning，这是对 RC1 reviewer concern 的直接回应。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Experiment 6: GPQA Cross-Benchmark Synthesis\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"GPQA Cross-Benchmark Synthesis & Updated C10\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_synthesis\"\n    claim: \"C10\"\n    description: >\n      综合 MATH-500 + GSM8K + GPQA 三 benchmark 结果，更新 C10\n      claim，产出论文 §4.4 cross-benchmark subsection 所需数据。\n    expected_results:\n      cross_benchmark_importance_gradient_spearman:\n        math500_vs_gsm8k: 1.0\n        math500_vs_gpqa: 1.0\n        gsm8k_vs_gpqa: 1.0\n      cross_benchmark_magnitude_ordering:\n        s015: \"MATH-500 (0.39) > GSM8K (0.241) > GPQA (0.16)\"\n        s020: \"MATH-500 (1.21) > GSM8K (0.740) > GPQA (0.50)\"\n        s025: \"MATH-500 (3.99) > GSM8K (1.992) > GPQA (1.40)\"\n        s030: \"MATH-500 (8.48) > GSM8K (4.682) > GPQA (3.15)\"\n      magnitude_ordering_consistent: true\n      strategy_specificity_summary:\n        math500_ds: \"15-36×\"\n        math500_qw: \"2.7-20×\"\n        gsm8k_ds: \"2.3-3.8×\"\n        gpqa_ds: \"3.2-3.7×\"\n      gpqa_bonferroni_p_weakest: 0.028  # s015\n      c10_updated_status: \"confirmed (with attenuated specificity caveat)\"\n      framing_update: >\n        C10 confirmed: phase gradient cross-benchmark robust\n        (Spearman ρ=1.0 all pairwise); strategy specificity\n        task-modulated (MATH-500 >> GSM8K ≈ GPQA). Title\n        adjustment supported: \"phase-dependent\" (universal)\n        rather than \"phase-gated\" (binary). Discussion §5 new\n        subsection: moderating factors (task complexity, reasoning\n        chain length, domain specificity).\n    result_rationale: >\n      三 benchmark importance dose-response 全部单调递增（Spearman\n      ρ=1.0），这是 phase gradient universality 的最强证据。量级\n      梯度 MATH-500 > GSM8K > GPQA 与 reasoning chain\n      characteristics 相关：MATH-500 要求最长最复杂的 step-by-step\n      derivation（median reasoning tokens ≈ 2000+），GSM8K 推理链\n      较短但仍为数学计算，GPQA 涉及跨领域知识检索，推理结构更扁平。\n      Strategy specificity 的 task-dependence 有两个可能解释：\n      (1) Reasoning chain length hypothesis: 更长的推理链允许\n      importance score 在 phase 间积累更大的判别力差异，使 importance\n      eviction 与 random eviction 的 compound effect 差异放大；\n      (2) Domain specificity hypothesis: 数学推理的 attention\n      pattern 在 thinking vs answering phase 间差异最大（因为\n      derivation vs summarization 是质的不同），而 GPQA 的知识\n      检索在两个 phase 间的 attention 差异较小。两个假说不互斥，\n      目前数据不能区分，这是 §6 Discussion 中标注的开放问题。\n      将三 benchmark 汇总后，C10 升级为 confirmed（从仅 GSM8K\n      扩展到 GPQA），附带 \"attenuated specificity on non-math and\n      simpler benchmarks\" 限定。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table X: Cross-benchmark synthesis (paper §4.4)\"\n        columns: [\"metric\", \"MATH-500\", \"GSM8K\", \"GPQA\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Models tested\", \"DS+QW\", \"DS+QW\", \"DS\"]\n          - [\"n_problems\", \"500\", \"50\", \"50\"]\n          - [\"Importance gradient s015→s030\", \"0.39→8.48\", \"0.241→4.682\", \"0.16→3.15\"]\n          - [\"Dose-response ρ\", \"1.0\", \"1.0\", \"1.0\"]\n          - [\"Bonferroni all sig?\", \"Yes (4/4)\", \"Yes (4/4)\", \"Yes (4/4)\"]\n          - [\"imp/rand ratio (DS)\", \"15-36×\", \"2.3-3.8×\", \"3.2-3.7×\"]\n          - [\"Random onset threshold\", \"~s025\", \"NS all (n=50)\", \"~s030\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig (paper Figure 5): 3-panel cross-benchmark: (a) importance dose-response 三曲线, (b) imp/rand ratio bar chart, (c) random onset threshold comparison\"\n      - \"Fig (supplementary): per-problem II distribution comparison across 3 benchmarks at matched sparsity (s025)\"\n    analysis: >\n      GPQA 的纳入从根本上改变了论文的 generalizability narrative：\n      从 \"two math benchmarks\" 升级为 \"mathematical reasoning\n      (MATH-500), arithmetic (GSM8K), and cross-domain graduate\n      reasoning (GPQA)\"。这直接回应 RC1 (generalizability concern)\n      的最大弱点。代价是 strategy specificity claim 的 softening——\n      从 \"importance masking is uniquely phase-sensitive\" 到\n      \"importance masking shows the strongest phase-dependence,\n      with specificity modulated by task characteristics\"。Net\n      effect on paper competitiveness: positive. EMNLP reviewers\n      更看重 breadth of validation 而非 single strong result。\n      三 benchmark 的一致 dose-response (ρ=1.0) 比单个 benchmark\n      的 extreme ratio (36×) 更有说服力。Paper positioning shift:\n      \"first systematic quantification of phase-dependent compound\n      severity across models, architectures, and reasoning tasks.\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":57140,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":57140},"output_tokens":21,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0c55458c-8a10-4e57-820a-a9e9dbcbc079","uuid":"02bf36b9-fe73-4bf3-8680-ff1e7ad087ef"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":573213,"duration_api_ms":575061,"num_turns":1,"result":"我来查看项目目录确认当前状态，然后生成完整的 median tier 预测数据。\n\nLooking at the experiment_plan — all entries are `status: DONE`, but the registry has two RUNNING experiments (`c8_llama_n250_fixed`, `gpqa_ds_importance_s015`), and one partial result (`c8_llama_gpu0_s025` with n=250 importance s025 actual data). These plus the remaining GPQA conditions are the \"planned\" experiments to predict under median tier.\n\n```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Phase gradient universality 成为主线——跨模型/架构/benchmark 一致\n  （importance d_z≈1.0-1.2 across all）。Strategy modulation 降为\n  moderated effect：Qwen2 架构 + 高难度推理最强（MATH-500 15-36×），\n  LLaMA 架构和简单/跨领域 task 上衰减（GSM8K 2.3-3.8×, GPQA 2-5×）。\n  Title 从 \"phase-gated\" 调整为 \"phase-dependent compound sparsity\"。\n  C1 claim 措辞从 \"strategy-modulated\" 改为 \"strategy-modulated with\n  architecture-dependent magnitude\"。C8 诚实报告：LLaMA n=250 确认\n  importance phase gradient 强（d_z≈1.0-1.1），但 imp_vs_rand 差异\n  仅 small effect（d_z 0.16-0.34），random 也显示非平凡 phase gradient\n  （d_z 0.30-0.38）。GPQA 纳入作为第三 benchmark 但加 \"attenuated\n  specificity\" 限定。EMNLP main 仍可投——pitch 调整为 \"first\n  quantitative characterization of phase-dependent compound severity\n  + dose-response + discrimination collapse mechanism\"，novelty 重心\n  从三维交互发现转向 systematic quantification + mechanism。需重写\n  §1 motivation 段（强调 phase gradient universality 而非\n  strategy-specificity）和 §5 Discussion（增加 moderating factors\n  及 architecture-dependence 分析）。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Experiment 1: LLaMA n=250 Importance Phase Gradient (Full)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"LLaMA n=250 Importance Phase Gradient (Full Suite)\"\n    plan_id: \"c8_llama_n250_importance\"\n    claim: \"C8\"\n    description: >\n      DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B, n=250, importance masking,\n      4 sparsity levels (s015/s020/s025/s030). Per-problem paired\n      phase gradient analysis, B=10000 bootstrap. s025 已有实际\n      数据 (c8_llama_gpu0_s025)，其余 3 个 sparsity 为预测。\n    expected_results:\n      model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B\n      n_problems: 250\n      n_valid: 244\n      n_bootstrap: 10000\n      segmentation: quantile\n      per_phase_ii_median:\n        s015:\n          high: 0.0028\n          mid: 0.0230\n          low: 0.0620\n        s020:\n          high: 0.0065\n          mid: 0.0680\n          low: 0.190\n        s025:  # actual from c8_llama_gpu0_s025\n          high: 0.0171\n          mid: 0.1916\n          low: 0.388\n        s030:\n          high: 0.0340\n          mid: 0.480\n          low: 1.080\n      phase_gradient_median_diff:\n        s015: 0.059\n        s020: 0.183\n        s025: 0.376  # actual\n        s030: 1.046\n      phase_gradient_median_diff_ci95:\n        s015: [0.046, 0.074]\n        s020: [0.148, 0.223]\n        s025: [0.315, 0.404]  # actual partial\n        s030: [0.870, 1.255]\n      phase_gradient_importance_dz:\n        s015: 1.03\n        s020: 1.08\n        s025: 1.12  # actual\n        s030: 1.02\n      phase_gradient_importance_dz_ci:\n        s015: [0.82, 1.28]\n        s020: [0.89, 1.30]\n        s025: [0.93, 1.34]\n        s030: [0.84, 1.24]\n      wilcoxon_p_one_sided:\n        s015: 5.0e-33\n        s020: 8.0e-37\n        s025: 4.3e-39  # actual\n        s030: 3.0e-35\n      bonferroni_p_k4:\n        s015: 2.0e-32\n        s020: 3.2e-36\n        s025: 1.7e-38\n        s030: 1.2e-34\n      rank_biserial_r:\n        s015: 0.845\n        s020: 0.860\n        s025: 0.869  # actual\n        s030: 0.850\n      bonferroni_all_significant: true\n      all_dz_above_1: true\n      interpretation: \"all_large\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      n=49 已显示 LLaMA importance phase gradient d_z 全部 >1.0\n      （1.00-1.12），属 large effect。n 从 49 增到 250 不改变效应量\n      （总体参数不变），但 CI 收窄约 √(250/49)≈2.26 倍。s025 已有\n      实际 n=250 数据（d_z=1.12, p=4.3e-39, r=0.87）验证了这一\n      预期。其余 3 个 sparsity 按 n=49 d_z 模式外推：d_z 稳定在\n      1.02-1.12 区间。median_diff 绝对值随 sparsity 单调递增\n      （0.059→0.183→0.376→1.046），反映 compound severity 的\n      dose-response 关系在 LLaMA 上同样成立。关键对比：LLaMA s030\n      median_diff≈1.05 远小于 DeepSeek s030≈8.48 和 Qwen s030≈3.16，\n      说明 compound interaction 的绝对量级是 architecture-dependent 的；\n      但 d_z 一致 >1.0 说明效应的 relative magnitude（相对于 within-\n      problem variance）跨架构稳健。这一模式支持 \"phase gradient\n      universality\" 的 core narrative。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table X: LLaMA n=250 importance phase gradient summary\"\n        columns: [\"sparsity\", \"high_II_median\", \"low_II_median\", \"median_diff\", \"d_z\", \"95% CI\", \"Bonferroni p\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s015\", 0.003, 0.062, 0.059, 1.03, \"[0.82, 1.28]\", \"2.0e-32\"]\n          - [\"s020\", 0.007, 0.190, 0.183, 1.08, \"[0.89, 1.30]\", \"3.2e-36\"]\n          - [\"s025*\", 0.017, 0.388, 0.376, 1.12, \"[0.93, 1.34]\", \"1.7e-38\"]\n          - [\"s030\", 0.034, 1.080, 1.046, 1.02, \"[0.84, 1.24]\", \"1.2e-34\"]\n        note: \"* s025 为 c8_llama_gpu0_s025 实际数据\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 三架构 importance phase gradient d_z 对比柱状图（DS medium-to-large 0.44-0.80 / QW 0.37-1.44 / LLaMA all >1.0），highlight universality\"\n      - \"Fig: LLaMA n=250 per-phase II median 随 sparsity 变化的折线图（3 lines: high/mid/low phase），显示 phase separation 随 sparsity 递增\"\n    analysis: >\n      Importance phase gradient 在 LLaMA n=250 下全部 4 个 sparsity\n      级别 Bonferroni p < 1e-30，d_z 一致 >1.0。这是 C8 claim 中\n      最强的证据——phase gradient 的 universality 跨架构成立。注意\n      LLaMA d_z (≈1.0-1.1) 甚至高于 DeepSeek 早期数据 (0.44-0.80)，\n      但 median_diff 绝对值远小（LLaMA s030≈1.05 vs DS≈8.48）。\n      这意味着 LLaMA 的 within-problem variance 更小，使得 d_z\n      inflate，论文需注意同时报告 d_z 和 median_diff 以避免误导。\n      n=250 的功效远超需要（power>0.999），支持 §4 报告 \"the\n      importance phase gradient is robust across architectures with\n      uniformly large effect sizes.\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Experiment 2: LLaMA n=250 Random Phase Gradient (Full)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"LLaMA n=250 Random Phase Gradient (Full Suite)\"\n    plan_id: \"c8_llama_n250_random\"\n    claim: \"C8\"\n    description: >\n      DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B, n=250, random masking,\n      4 sparsity levels. 验证 n=49 观察到的 LLaMA random non-trivial\n      phase gradient 在更大样本下是否持续且 CI 稳定排除零。\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 250\n      n_valid: 244\n      n_bootstrap: 10000\n      per_phase_ii_median:\n        s015:\n          high: 0.020\n          mid: 0.035\n          low: 0.052\n        s020:\n          high: 0.038\n          mid: 0.068\n          low: 0.105\n        s025:\n          high: 0.085\n          mid: 0.170\n          low: 0.290\n        s030:\n          high: 0.155\n          mid: 0.340\n          low: 0.560\n      phase_gradient_median_diff:\n        s015: 0.032\n        s020: 0.067\n        s025: 0.205\n        s030: 0.405\n      phase_gradient_median_diff_ci95:\n        s015: [0.014, 0.054]\n        s020: [0.035, 0.105]\n        s025: [0.130, 0.295]\n        s030: [0.260, 0.570]\n      phase_gradient_random_dz:\n        s015: 0.30\n        s020: 0.33\n        s025: 0.38\n        s030: 0.37\n      phase_gradient_random_dz_ci:\n        s015: [0.17, 0.44]\n        s020: [0.20, 0.47]\n        s025: [0.25, 0.52]\n        s030: [0.24, 0.51]\n      wilcoxon_p_one_sided:\n        s015: 8.0e-5\n        s020: 2.0e-5\n        s025: 5.0e-7\n        s030: 8.0e-7\n      bonferroni_p_k4:\n        s015: 3.2e-4\n        s020: 8.0e-5\n        s025: 2.0e-6\n        s030: 3.2e-6\n      bonferroni_all_significant: true\n      all_ci_exclude_zero: true\n      interpretation: \"all_small\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      n=49 时 LLaMA random phase gradient d_z 0.35-0.44，CI 下界\n      均 >0（0.07-0.20）。这是与 DeepSeek/Qwen 的关键差异：Qwen2\n      架构上 random phase gradient 在 s015/s020 NS（DS s015 p=0.86,\n      QW s015 p=0.17），而 LLaMA 全部显著。n=250 下效应量预期稳定\n      或略降（regression to mean），d_z 落在 0.30-0.38（median tier\n      范围 [0.25, 0.40]）。CI 收窄使全部 4 级 Bonferroni 显著。\n      d_z 略低于 n=49 估计是预期的——n=49 时 sampling variability\n      可能使 d_z 偏高（特别是 s025 d_z=0.45 → n=250 预期 0.38）。\n      Random phase gradient 的 significance 意味着在 LLaMA 上，\n      compound interaction 的 phase-dependence 不是 strategy-specific\n      的——importance 和 random eviction 都产生 phase gradient，\n      importance 只是量级更大。机制假说：LLaMA 架构的 GQA (grouped\n      query attention) 使得 head pruning 即使在 random 条件下也\n      系统性地更多影响某些 phase 的 attention pattern，而 Qwen2\n      的 MHA 结构下 random pruning 的影响更均匀分布在 phases 间。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table X: Random phase gradient cross-architecture comparison\"\n        columns: [\"sparsity\", \"LLaMA d_z (n=250)\", \"DS d_z (n=500)\", \"QW d_z (n=500)\", \"LLaMA sig?\", \"DS sig?\", \"QW sig?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s015\", 0.30, \"—\", \"—\", \"✓\", \"NS (p=0.86)\", \"NS (p=0.17)\"]\n          - [\"s020\", 0.33, \"—\", \"—\", \"✓\", \"NS (p=0.28)\", \"NS (p=0.20)\"]\n          - [\"s025\", 0.38, \"—\", \"—\", \"✓\", \"✓ (p=0.006)\", \"✓ (p<1e-10)\"]\n          - [\"s030\", 0.37, \"—\", \"—\", \"✓\", \"✓ (p=0.006)\", \"✓ (p<1e-14)\"]\n        note: \"DS/QW random d_z not directly comparable (different test framework); sig status from c2_n500 Bonferroni\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Random phase gradient 三架构对比——LLaMA 全 4 级显著 (small effect) vs DS/QW 仅 s025+ 显著，highlight architecture-dependent pattern\"\n    analysis: >\n      Random phase gradient 在 LLaMA n=250 上全部 Bonferroni 显著\n      但为 small effect (d_z 0.30-0.38)，是论文中需诚实报告的关键\n      发现。它削弱 \"strategy specificity\" narrative 但加强 \"phase\n      gradient universality\" narrative。对 C8 的 implication：LLaMA\n      上 compound interaction 的 phase-dependence 是 strategy-\n      independent 的（importance 和 random 都有 phase gradient），\n      strategy 的作用仅在 magnitude modulation（importance d_z≈1.1\n      vs random d_z≈0.35，ratio≈3:1）。Discussion §5 需增加：\n      \"architecture-dependent strategy sensitivity\"，讨论 GQA vs\n      MHA 可能导致的差异。Limitations 中标注：LLaMA random phase\n      gradient 的机制为开放问题。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Experiment 3: LLaMA n=250 Strategy×Phase Interaction\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"LLaMA n=250 Strategy×Phase Interaction (imp_vs_rand d_z)\"\n    plan_id: \"c8_llama_n250_interaction\"\n    claim: \"C8\"\n    description: >\n      n=250 paired imp_vs_rand d_z analysis across 4 sparsity levels.\n      核心问题：n=49 时仅 s030 Bonferroni 显著 (p=0.029, d_z=0.34)，\n      n=250 是否将更多 sparsity 级别推入显著区。\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 250\n      n_valid: 244\n      bonferroni_k: 4\n      imp_vs_rand_dz:\n        s015: 0.16\n        s020: 0.21\n        s025: 0.27\n        s030: 0.34\n      imp_vs_rand_dz_ci:\n        s015: [-0.01, 0.33]\n        s020: [0.05, 0.38]\n        s025: [0.11, 0.44]\n        s030: [0.18, 0.50]\n      imp_vs_rand_dz_interpretation:\n        s015: negligible\n        s020: small\n        s025: small\n        s030: small\n      median_diff_imp_vs_rand:\n        s015: 0.027\n        s020: 0.116\n        s025: 0.171\n        s030: 0.641\n      median_diff_ci:\n        s015: [-0.003, 0.062]\n        s020: [0.012, 0.235]\n        s025: [0.040, 0.330]\n        s030: [0.210, 1.120]\n      wilcoxon_p_raw:\n        s015: 0.048\n        s020: 0.015\n        s025: 0.0008\n        s030: 0.00004\n      wilcoxon_p_bonferroni:\n        s015: 0.192\n        s020: 0.060\n        s025: 0.003\n        s030: 0.0002\n      significant_bonferroni:\n        s015: false\n        s020: false\n        s025: true\n        s030: true\n      bonferroni_sig_count_out_of_4: 2\n      imp_vs_rand_dz_monotonic: true\n      cross_arch_comparison:\n        deepseek_n500_imp_rand_ratio: \"15.5-38.6×\"\n        qwen_n500_imp_rand_ratio: \"2.7-20.1×\"\n        llama_n250_importance_over_random_dz_ratio:\n          s015: 3.4  # 1.03 / 0.30\n          s020: 3.3  # 1.08 / 0.33\n          s025: 2.9  # 1.12 / 0.38\n          s030: 2.8  # 1.02 / 0.37\n    result_rationale: >\n      n=49 的 imp_vs_rand d_z 为 0.19/0.26/0.29/0.34（s015→s030），\n      仅 s030 Bonferroni 显著 (p=0.029)。效应量是总体参数，n=250\n      不改变 d_z，但统计功效大幅提升（power from ~0.35 to >0.95 for\n      d_z=0.34）。具体推算：(1) d_z=0.34 at n=244: Wilcoxon p≈4e-5,\n      Bonferroni p≈0.0002 → highly significant; (2) d_z=0.27 at n=244:\n      p≈8e-4, Bonferroni p≈0.003 → significant; (3) d_z=0.21 at n=244:\n      p≈0.015, Bonferroni p≈0.060 → borderline NS (刚好不过 0.05);\n      (4) d_z=0.16 at n=244: p≈0.048, Bonferroni p≈0.19 → NS。因此\n      sig_count=2（s025+s030），落在 median tier 范围 [1, 2]。d_z\n      values 轻微收缩 vs n=49（regression to mean）：n=49 0.29→n=250\n      0.27 for s025，n=49 0.34→n=250 0.34 for s030（已在 asymptote）。\n      核心结论：imp_vs_rand 交互存在（monotonic d_z, 2/4 Bonferroni\n      sig），但为 small effect。对比 Qwen2 架构上 d_z 0.37-1.44\n      (median-to-large)，LLaMA 上 strategy×phase 交互弱了 3-4 倍。\n      这不是 null result（d_z 非零，且单调递增），而是 \"confirmed as\n      small\" —— 从 n=49 的 \"suggestive\" 升级为 n=250 的 \"definitively\n      small\"。论文中这是 informative：排除了 LLaMA 上存在强\n      strategy×phase 交互的可能性，支持 \"architecture-dependent\n      modulation\" 的 claim。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table X: imp_vs_rand d_z across architectures × sparsity\"\n        columns: [\"sparsity\", \"LLaMA d_z (n=250)\", \"DS d_z (ref)\", \"QW Cohen's d (ref)\", \"LLaMA Bonf. p\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s015\", 0.16, 0.44, 0.37, \"0.192 (NS)\"]\n          - [\"s020\", 0.21, 0.52, 0.72, \"0.060 (NS)\"]\n          - [\"s025\", 0.27, 0.68, 1.23, \"0.003 *\"]\n          - [\"s030\", 0.34, 0.80, 1.44, \"0.0002 **\"]\n        note: \"DS d_z from bf16 paired Cohen's d (different metric); QW Cohen's d from bf16_qw_imp paired test. Cross-metric comparison qualitative only.\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: imp_vs_rand d_z 对比三架构柱状图 — Qwen2 medium-to-large, DeepSeek medium, LLaMA small，清晰展示 architecture-dependent attenuation\"\n    analysis: >\n      C8 在 n=250 下维持 partially_confirmed。核心更新：\n      (1) importance phase gradient: confirmed at large effect (d_z>1.0, all Bonferroni sig) ✓;\n      (2) imp_vs_rand interaction: confirmed as small effect (d_z 0.16-0.34, 2/4 Bonferroni sig);\n      (3) random phase gradient: confirmed as non-trivial (d_z 0.30-0.38, all Bonferroni sig).\n      论文措辞 update: \"Cross-architecture replication on LLaMA-8B\n      (n=250) confirms the universality of phase-dependent compound\n      severity (importance d_z=1.02-1.12, all p<1e-30), while\n      revealing that strategy specificity is architecture-modulated:\n      the importance-over-random contrast is a small effect\n      (d_z=0.16-0.34, 2/4 Bonferroni significant) compared to\n      medium-to-large effects on Qwen2 architecture (Cohen's d\n      0.37-1.44). Notably, random masking on LLaMA also exhibits\n      significant phase gradients (d_z=0.30-0.38, all p<0.001),\n      unlike the null pattern at low sparsity on Qwen2 models.\"\n      C8 status 用词：partially_confirmed (qualitative direction ✓,\n      strategy specificity quantitatively weak).\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Experiment 4: GPQA DeepSeek Importance Phase Gradient\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"GPQA DeepSeek Importance Phase Gradient (Dose-Response)\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_importance\"\n    claim: \"C10_GPQA\"\n    description: >\n      DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B on GPQA-Diamond subset, n=50,\n      importance masking, 4 sparsity levels (s015/s020/s025/s030).\n      Per-problem paired median difference + Wilcoxon + bootstrap\n      (B=10000). 验证 phase gradient 在第三个 benchmark（跨领域\n      graduate-level reasoning）上的存在性和 dose-response。\n    expected_results:\n      model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\n      benchmark: GPQA-Diamond\n      n_problems: 50\n      n_valid: 48\n      n_bootstrap: 10000\n      method: \"median + Wilcoxon + bootstrap_median(B=10000)\"\n      importance:\n        s015:\n          median_gradient: 0.16\n          ci_low: 0.04\n          ci_high: 0.33\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.007\n        s020:\n          median_gradient: 0.50\n          ci_low: 0.22\n          ci_high: 0.85\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.0003\n        s025:\n          median_gradient: 1.40\n          ci_low: 0.65\n          ci_high: 2.30\n          wilcoxon_p: 2.0e-5\n        s030:\n          median_gradient: 3.15\n          ci_low: 1.55\n          ci_high: 5.20\n          wilcoxon_p: 5.0e-7\n      wilcoxon_p_bonferroni:\n        s015: 0.028\n        s020: 0.001\n        s025: 8.0e-5\n        s030: 2.0e-6\n      cohens_dz:\n        s015: 0.42\n        s020: 0.58\n        s025: 0.72\n        s030: 0.85\n      bonferroni_all_4_significant: true\n      dose_response_monotonic: true\n      dose_response_spearman_rho: 1.0\n      gpqa_vs_math500_ratio:\n        s015: 0.41  # 0.16 / 0.39\n        s020: 0.41  # 0.50 / 1.21\n        s025: 0.35  # 1.40 / 3.99\n        s030: 0.37  # 3.15 / 8.48\n    result_rationale: >\n      GPQA-Diamond 是 graduate-level 跨领域推理 benchmark（物理/\n      化学/生物等），与 MATH-500 的纯数学推理在三方面关键不同：\n      (1) 推理链更短——GPQA 问题通常不需要 MATH-500 那样长的 step-\n      by-step derivation，低 phase 区间更短，compound interaction\n      积累更少；(2) 涉及领域知识 recall 而非纯逻辑推演——knowledge\n      retrieval 对 KV cache 的依赖模式不同于 logical chaining；\n      (3) attention 模式在 phase 间可能更均匀——graduate-level\n      problems 的 \"thinking\" 和 \"answering\" 在 attention structure\n      上的差异小于 math proofs。因此 phase gradient 预期存在但量级\n      约为 MATH-500 的 35-41%（0.16/0.50/1.40/3.15 vs\n      0.39/1.21/3.99/8.48）。衰减比例与 GSM8K 互补：GSM8K 衰减因\n      推理链更简单（fewer phase-specific computations），GPQA 衰减\n      因跨领域知识检索减弱 phase specificity。s015 Bonferroni\n      p≈0.028 落在 median tier 目标 [0.01, 0.05] 内——足够显著但\n      远弱于 MATH-500 s015 的 p<1e-70，诚实反映 GPQA 效应较弱。\n      全 4 级显著是 median tier 的 optimistic 端——如果 s015 效应\n      更弱（median_diff≈0.10），Bonferroni p 可能 >0.05，此时\n      叙事调整为 \"gradient emerges at s020+ on GPQA\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table X: GPQA importance dose-response\"\n        columns: [\"sparsity\", \"median_gradient\", \"95% CI\", \"Bonferroni p\", \"d_z\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s015\", 0.16, \"[0.04, 0.33]\", 0.028, 0.42]\n          - [\"s020\", 0.50, \"[0.22, 0.85]\", 0.001, 0.58]\n          - [\"s025\", 1.40, \"[0.65, 2.30]\", \"8.0e-5\", 0.72]\n          - [\"s030\", 3.15, \"[1.55, 5.20]\", \"2.0e-6\", 0.85]\n      - name: \"Table X: Cross-benchmark importance gradient comparison\"\n        columns: [\"sparsity\", \"MATH-500 (DS n=500)\", \"GSM8K (DS n=50)\", \"GPQA (DS n=50)\", \"GPQA/MATH ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s015\", 0.39, 0.241, 0.16, \"0.41\"]\n          - [\"s020\", 1.21, 0.740, 0.50, \"0.41\"]\n          - [\"s025\", 3.99, 1.992, 1.40, \"0.35\"]\n          - [\"s030\", 8.48, 4.682, 3.15, \"0.37\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 三 benchmark importance dose-response 曲线对比 (MATH-500 >> GSM8K > GPQA)，显示 universal monotonic pattern with task-dependent magnitude\"\n      - \"Fig: GPQA per-phase II 分布 violin plot (n=50)，类似 fig4_per_problem_dist 格式\"\n    analysis: >\n      GPQA 确认 phase gradient 的 cross-benchmark robustness，\n      dose-response 单调递增且 Spearman ρ=1.0。GPQA 的量级约为\n      MATH-500 的 35-41%，衰减幅度略大于 GSM8K（GSM8K/MATH ≈\n      55-62%），形成 MATH-500 > GSM8K > GPQA 的量级梯度。三\n      benchmark 的重要共性：(1) 全部单调递增；(2) 全部 importance\n      显著；(3) dose-response Spearman ρ=1.0。差异：(1) 绝对量级\n      按 reasoning chain complexity 递减；(2) s015 的 significance\n      在 GPQA 上为 borderline（Bonf. p=0.028），而 MATH-500 上\n      overwhelmingly significant (p<1e-70)。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Experiment 5: GPQA DeepSeek Random Phase Gradient\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"GPQA DeepSeek Random Phase Gradient\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_random\"\n    claim: \"C10_GPQA\"\n    description: >\n      DeepSeek on GPQA-Diamond, n=50, random masking, 4 sparsity\n      levels. 测量 GPQA 上 strategy specificity (imp/rand ratio)\n      的衰减程度。\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 50\n      n_valid: 48\n      n_bootstrap: 10000\n      random:\n        s015:\n          median_gradient: 0.05\n          ci_low: -0.05\n          ci_high: 0.18\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.28\n        s020:\n          median_gradient: 0.15\n          ci_low: -0.02\n          ci_high: 0.38\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.06\n        s025:\n          median_gradient: 0.38\n          ci_low: 0.10\n          ci_high: 0.75\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.012\n        s030:\n          median_gradient: 0.92\n          ci_low: 0.35\n          ci_high: 1.65\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.002\n      wilcoxon_p_bonferroni:\n        s015: 1.0\n        s020: 0.24\n        s025: 0.048\n        s030: 0.008\n      significant_bonferroni:\n        s015: false\n        s020: false\n        s025: false  # 0.048 borderline, 保守报告为 NS\n        s030: true\n      random_dose_response_monotonic: true\n      imp_rand_ratio:\n        s015: 3.2\n        s020: 3.3\n        s025: 3.7\n        s030: 3.4\n      imp_rand_ratio_range: \"3.2-3.7×\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      GPQA 上 imp/rand ratio 预期为 2-5×，类 GSM8K 模式（MATH-500\n      为 15-36×）。三重衰减因素：(1) GPQA 跨领域 attention 模式更\n      均匀——importance score 的 phase-specific 判别力原本就弱于纯\n      数学推理，因此 importance 和 random eviction 的 compound effect\n      差异缩小；(2) GPQA 推理链较短，限制了 importance score 在\n      phase 间积累判别力差异的机会（fewer tokens = less discrimination\n      accumulation）；(3) graduate-level 问题涉及 factual recall，\n      attention pattern 在 thinking 和 answering 间的差异小于\n      mathematical derivation。具体校准：MATH-500 n=500 DS random\n      s025 median_diff=0.26, importance=3.99 → ratio=15.5×。GPQA\n      预期 random s025≈0.38, importance≈1.40 → ratio≈3.7×。GPQA\n      random 在 s030 Bonferroni 显著 (p≈0.008)，与 MATH-500 n=500\n      DS random s030 模式一致 (Bonf. p=0.006)——random 的 onset\n      threshold (~s025-s030) 跨 benchmark 相对稳定，但 ratio 衰减。\n      s025 Bonferroni p=0.048 技术上跨 0.05 threshold，保守报告\n      为 NS 以避免 borderline claim。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table X: imp/rand ratio across 3 benchmarks\"\n        columns: [\"benchmark\", \"ratio range\", \"pattern\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MATH-500 (DS n=500)\", \"15.5-38.6×\", \"strong specificity\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K (DS n=50)\", \"2.3-3.8×\", \"attenuated\"]\n          - [\"GPQA (DS n=50)\", \"3.2-3.7×\", \"attenuated\"]\n          - [\"MATH-500 (QW n=500)\", \"2.7-20.1×\", \"variable\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Strategy specificity (imp/rand ratio) 热力图: benchmark × sparsity level，MATH-500 暖色调 vs GSM8K/GPQA 冷色调\"\n    analysis: >\n      GPQA strategy specificity 衰减至 3.2-3.7×（vs MATH-500\n      15-36×），与 GSM8K 的 2.3-3.8× 处于同一数量级。Cross-benchmark\n      pattern: specificity ∝ reasoning chain complexity/length。\n      这对 C1 的 implication: strategy modulation 存在但其强度是\n      task-dependent 的，论文 C1 需加限定 \"strategy specificity is\n      most pronounced under demanding mathematical reasoning tasks\n      with extended inference chains, and attenuates on simpler or\n      cross-domain benchmarks to 2-5× range\"。GPQA 的加入使\n      cross-task 覆盖从 2 个 math benchmarks 扩展到 non-math\n      reasoning，这是对 RC1 reviewer concern 的直接回应。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Experiment 6: GPQA Cross-Benchmark Synthesis\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"GPQA Cross-Benchmark Synthesis & Updated C10\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_synthesis\"\n    claim: \"C10\"\n    description: >\n      综合 MATH-500 + GSM8K + GPQA 三 benchmark 结果，更新 C10\n      claim，产出论文 §4.4 cross-benchmark subsection 所需数据。\n    expected_results:\n      cross_benchmark_importance_gradient_spearman:\n        math500_vs_gsm8k: 1.0\n        math500_vs_gpqa: 1.0\n        gsm8k_vs_gpqa: 1.0\n      cross_benchmark_magnitude_ordering:\n        s015: \"MATH-500 (0.39) > GSM8K (0.241) > GPQA (0.16)\"\n        s020: \"MATH-500 (1.21) > GSM8K (0.740) > GPQA (0.50)\"\n        s025: \"MATH-500 (3.99) > GSM8K (1.992) > GPQA (1.40)\"\n        s030: \"MATH-500 (8.48) > GSM8K (4.682) > GPQA (3.15)\"\n      magnitude_ordering_consistent: true\n      strategy_specificity_summary:\n        math500_ds: \"15-36×\"\n        math500_qw: \"2.7-20×\"\n        gsm8k_ds: \"2.3-3.8×\"\n        gpqa_ds: \"3.2-3.7×\"\n      gpqa_bonferroni_p_weakest: 0.028  # s015\n      c10_updated_status: \"confirmed (with attenuated specificity caveat)\"\n      framing_update: >\n        C10 confirmed: phase gradient cross-benchmark robust\n        (Spearman ρ=1.0 all pairwise); strategy specificity\n        task-modulated (MATH-500 >> GSM8K ≈ GPQA). Title\n        adjustment supported: \"phase-dependent\" (universal)\n        rather than \"phase-gated\" (binary). Discussion §5 new\n        subsection: moderating factors (task complexity, reasoning\n        chain length, domain specificity).\n    result_rationale: >\n      三 benchmark importance dose-response 全部单调递增（Spearman\n      ρ=1.0），这是 phase gradient universality 的最强证据。量级\n      梯度 MATH-500 > GSM8K > GPQA 与 reasoning chain\n      characteristics 相关：MATH-500 要求最长最复杂的 step-by-step\n      derivation（median reasoning tokens ≈ 2000+），GSM8K 推理链\n      较短但仍为数学计算，GPQA 涉及跨领域知识检索，推理结构更扁平。\n      Strategy specificity 的 task-dependence 有两个可能解释：\n      (1) Reasoning chain length hypothesis: 更长的推理链允许\n      importance score 在 phase 间积累更大的判别力差异，使 importance\n      eviction 与 random eviction 的 compound effect 差异放大；\n      (2) Domain specificity hypothesis: 数学推理的 attention\n      pattern 在 thinking vs answering phase 间差异最大（因为\n      derivation vs summarization 是质的不同），而 GPQA 的知识\n      检索在两个 phase 间的 attention 差异较小。两个假说不互斥，\n      目前数据不能区分，这是 §6 Discussion 中标注的开放问题。\n      将三 benchmark 汇总后，C10 升级为 confirmed（从仅 GSM8K\n      扩展到 GPQA），附带 \"attenuated specificity on non-math and\n      simpler benchmarks\" 限定。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table X: Cross-benchmark synthesis (paper §4.4)\"\n        columns: [\"metric\", \"MATH-500\", \"GSM8K\", \"GPQA\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Models tested\", \"DS+QW\", \"DS+QW\", \"DS\"]\n          - [\"n_problems\", \"500\", \"50\", \"50\"]\n          - [\"Importance gradient s015→s030\", \"0.39→8.48\", \"0.241→4.682\", \"0.16→3.15\"]\n          - [\"Dose-response ρ\", \"1.0\", \"1.0\", \"1.0\"]\n          - [\"Bonferroni all sig?\", \"Yes (4/4)\", \"Yes (4/4)\", \"Yes (4/4)\"]\n          - [\"imp/rand ratio (DS)\", \"15-36×\", \"2.3-3.8×\", \"3.2-3.7×\"]\n          - [\"Random onset threshold\", \"~s025\", \"NS all (n=50)\", \"~s030\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig (paper Figure 5): 3-panel cross-benchmark: (a) importance dose-response 三曲线, (b) imp/rand ratio bar chart, (c) random onset threshold comparison\"\n      - \"Fig (supplementary): per-problem II distribution comparison across 3 benchmarks at matched sparsity (s025)\"\n    analysis: >\n      GPQA 的纳入从根本上改变了论文的 generalizability narrative：\n      从 \"two math benchmarks\" 升级为 \"mathematical reasoning\n      (MATH-500), arithmetic (GSM8K), and cross-domain graduate\n      reasoning (GPQA)\"。这直接回应 RC1 (generalizability concern)\n      的最大弱点。代价是 strategy specificity claim 的 softening——\n      从 \"importance masking is uniquely phase-sensitive\" 到\n      \"importance masking shows the strongest phase-dependence,\n      with specificity modulated by task characteristics\"。Net\n      effect on paper competitiveness: positive. EMNLP reviewers\n      更看重 breadth of validation 而非 single strong result。\n      三 benchmark 的一致 dose-response (ρ=1.0) 比单个 benchmark\n      的 extreme ratio (36×) 更有说服力。Paper positioning shift:\n      \"first systematic quantification of phase-dependent compound\n      severity across models, architectures, and reasoning tasks.\"\n```","stop_reason":"en